      "private": false,
      "reactions": {
        "like": 1
      },
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I have made a post such as this a year ago ... and of course ...it gain no traction ..... it may be far to difficult for them to do so ... since i had no response from it....\nBut the Idea works great when combatting \" Force Cloners \" and \" Avatar Rippers \" for both Public and Private....\nIt gives more control over the Individual user. \nSadly though...RipperStore still manages to Archive VRChat's Avatars......which that in itself is a security hole....",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
    {
      "__v": 0,
      "_id": "62d9a82781ce915b21189dd1",
      "author": {
        "_id": "5a995d0bbf71f62789f7311d",
        "alias": "Zircon blue Chameleon",
        "aliasID": "65c2d3d2ed6eefce4cafc83d",
        "anonymized": false,
        "avatarURL": "https://canny-assets.io/images/c70b7d92af598db0ef814ab09309a86e.png",
        "created": "2018-03-02T14:17:47.571Z",
        "name": "Sophie123p",
        "serviceAccount": false,
        "urlName": null
      },
      "authorID": null,
      "boardID": "58c62efae9868f3662e9d9a1",
      "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
      "created": "2022-07-21T19:25:27.686Z",
      "deleted": false,
      "fileURLs": [],
      "files": [],
      "imageURLs": [],
      "integrationSourceType": null,
      "internal": false,
      "itemSourceType": null,
      "mentionedUserIDs": null,
      "mentionedUsers": [],
      "mergeID": null,
      "parentID": null,
      "pinned": false,
      "postDeleted": false,
      "postID": "62d63ae34cc04b44a26825a5",
      "private": false,
      "reactions": {
        "like": 3
      },
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "While the idea will indeed stop or mitigate the ripping of avatars there are of course some issues that I have with this type of system:\nThe whole point of VRChat having custom avatars is to see them, now imagine this system being implemented. Who wants their avatar stolen, no one. You'll definitely use the system but now people cant see your avatar. You could join a friend only to disallowed to see their friends' avatars because they don't allow it, and sure they might give you permission but that's still an unknown factor. At the end of the day, I can't see this persons avatar and it feels more awkward since it's a fallback avatar.\nThis also won't fix it for every case for example the way ripperstore works is by using a mod and encouraging users to use it by offering private avatars, in which they gain points to buy private avatars. Who says your friends aren't using it? How can you trust them?\nUltimately, I understand your request for better avatar protection and the idea on paper sounds like it could work, in fact, it would work in practice, however you now have to ask the question, why even make a model if no one will see it? I feel that we will fear people in publics to the extent that no one with their own unique model would be seen for who they are, why should I make a model if I'm just going to be hidden from everyone?\nI'm sorry if I misunderstood something about your request, however I still believe the best way to solve this is simply using a public model you or someone else made, it still lets us see everyone for how they're meant to be seen while keeping some level of protection.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
    {
      "__v": 0,
      "_id": "62da9c2aff6f0a44c06dfa24",
      "author": {
        "_id": "6225948cbaa15338e5f5cefd",
        "alias": "Crimson Meadowlark",
        "aliasID": "65c3a0c1ed6eefce4cf638aa",
        "anonymized": false,
        "avatarURL": "https://canny-assets.io/images/4b7ae3b0f9b479f6c612e9de1ded2a20.png",
        "created": "2022-03-07T05:13:48.399Z",
        "name": "WingmanDraws",
